ns and modernity. During one summer, his destiny intersects with that of Olivia and Crocetta, two women from the area, the former a happy wife and the latter an ugly, unlucky wife. The three are forced by fortuitous circumstances to come together to save themselves but their behavior attracts the suspicions of Nino Malachia, a brusque police commissioner who is convinced that they are hiding something."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QOVRclSfCmlMUZYUHhbOhCgfrN.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wW5YjllCunTV8Jkop0dWCdswI0V.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":173847,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QOVRclSfCmlMUZYUHhbOhCgfrN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2QOVRclSfCmlMUZYUHhbOhCgfrN.jpg","language":"it","width":1080,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2QOVRclSfCmlMUZYUHhbOhCgfrN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2QOVRclSfCmlMUZYUHhbOhCgfrN.jpg","language":"it","width":1080,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qeMISD1IuG787qdflNlPfpKq62R.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qeMISD1IuG787qdflNlPfpKq62R.jpg","language":"it","width":501,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4rD3eOOyyzVmEPfk1dBadNMcRGN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4rD3eOOyyzVmEPfk1dBadNMcRGN.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wW5YjllCunTV8Jkop0d